{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_03_beg","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":6,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_02_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-3","storyName":"惶惑与冲动","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"庆功会上，因贪欲而陷入癫狂的深池被贪婪的红龙引入黑林。另一边，拉芙希妮和布莉吉从粮店老板的口中得知了提奥失踪的真相与走私粮车的去向。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_03_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":4,"next":6,"characters":["“官僚”","“酷吏”","“拷问者”","“监察官”","爱布拉娜","官僚","酷吏","监察官","拷问者","神秘的女性","作家","布莉吉","拉芙希妮","担忧的居民","校官","涅梅丝"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_59_g2_citystreets_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ghosthunter_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_ghosthunter_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_insectfly","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"一只甲虫低低飞过黑暗弥漫的街巷。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"它奋力振翅，却只不过闯进了一片几乎无人踏足的废弃街区。","id":12},{"type":"text","text":"纯金做的身躯太重，翅膀上的宝石也对飞翔无益。它飞了短短一点距离，就不得不趴在石板中间的缝隙处休息——","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$runsand","volume":"1","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-80,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":21},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"让你再跑！","id":24},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"抓住了，抓住了！","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":28},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"抓住你那破虫子就快去帮我捡水晶！快滚进阴沟里了！","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"我这就来——","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"不对，我要是帮你捡，你是不是得分我点什么？","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"分，分！你先来帮我捡！水晶滚进阴沟里，你难道不心疼？","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"哈哈，我的好云兽，这下你是我的了！","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"剑上的宝石......还好，还好，一个都没碰落......","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"“校官”他们呢？","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"管他们干什么？","id":38},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"charslot","id":42},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"官僚把蛀虫藏进怀里，酷吏不厌其烦地看着泪滴一次又一次滑落。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"拷问者粗鲁地摆弄云兽的肢体，监察官举起那柄剑，仿佛手执生杀的权力......","id":47},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"bgs","text":"","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","duration":"1","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"......呵，真热闹啊。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我当然可以把这些财宝赐给你们，我的仆臣们。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"你们喜欢这些东西到这种地步，要是不满足你们，不解风情的反倒是我了。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"可我把这些给了你们之后，你们又想从我手中拿走什么呢？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"让我猜猜......","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9d/Avg_avg_450_necras_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_59_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":66},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"-240","yFrom":"70","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","xScaleFrom":"1.4","yScaleFrom":"1.4","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"25","block":"false","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"不知为何，原本断了头的小巷中凭空生出一条路来，更多璀璨夺目的东西朝着路的尽头涌去。","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"人们已经无暇抚弄手里的东西了。","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"他们把地上的财宝捡起来，塞进口袋，或是背在身上，连腰都来不及直起来，就奔向下一个闪闪发光的地方。","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"没人关心这条路通往何方。","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"官僚","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"官僚","text":"......明天我就去多索雷斯，倒腾了那么多货，我早该给自己买点东西了......","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"酷吏","text":"......纳斯尔纱这帮乡巴佬，该再榨一榨他们的油水......","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"监察官","text":"......别忘了分我些......","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拷问者","text":"......等城里人真把“维多利亚间谍”送到我这儿来......","id":78},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"哈，听听，你们贪图的何止是财宝啊。","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"优渥的生活，高贵的地位，横流的物欲，生杀的权柄......你们都想要。","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"我不讨厌忠于自己欲望的人，你们要的东西，送人也没什么可惜。","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"可唯一不巧的是，你们是我的仆臣，而你们似乎比我还贪婪得多。","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"......再见，去你们该去的地方吧。","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"财宝于无路处凭空铺成一条闪闪发光的路，送彻底癫狂的人群走出巢穴，走上大地......","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"走向黑暗的来处，那残忍地张开大口的黑林。","id":87},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"cg","duration":"2","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":92},{"type":"cg","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"image","id":95},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":98},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":99,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":101},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"......这一段，和您之前讲的东西，风格完全不同。","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"我早就说过，观察、灵感、写作过程中废掉的文本，我会一股脑抛出来。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"如果我真的能将这个故事完完整整地用统一的风格讲完，那我也不用在这里喝馊掉的啤酒了。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"非要给故事一个结局的人是你，不是我。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"的确如此。","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"不过，如果我非要把这一段当成您的创作，是不是可以说，前面那位布莉吉小姐被黑雾拒绝也算是创作？","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......至少不比你硬塞到故事里的“放逐王”更“创作”。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#7$1","focus":"n","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"那么，接下来您要讲的，又到底是观察，还是创作呢？","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"如果你愿意，就自己去区分。你到底还想不想让我讲下去？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"当然，当然......","id":121},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_bg_59_g10_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":131,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"1.5","keep":"true","initamount":"0.7","amount":"0","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","duration":"0.7","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"艾玛她到底怎么了？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"只是轻微的营养不良，外加受了风寒。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"她在黑林外边的时候，看起来可没病这么重啊。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......多半是心病。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"打造雕像的铁要挨家挨户收集，人们为了节省燃料连灯都不愿意开，更别说食物了......","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"她能押什么东西出去？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"她是粮店老板，所以......？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但她也只是个粮店老板，一个人不可能做到这些。多半有人指使她。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我们还有提奥的事要问，没时间等她自己醒过来了。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"呃——嗬！","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"艾玛，你醒了？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"尼亚——尼亚尔！","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"你带我走吧......你带我走吧！","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，她还睡着。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"她好像在喊一个人的名字......尼亚尔？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"“尼亚尔”......有这个署名给她寄过信，应该是亲近的人吧。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这个人现在在哪？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不知道，但这个人有段时间没给艾玛寄过信了。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"尼亚尔......","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"你骂我吧，打我也可以，只是别丢下我不管......","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"“官僚”让我运粮食，我就运......你死在战场上，我活着又有什么意思？我对别人好，又能怎么样？","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“官僚”......是深池的人。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"反正城里那么多粮食，就运一车，不会有事的......","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"反正城里的粮食已经没有了，就算这一车运出去，也不会有事的......","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"不会有事的......","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我们......还要叫醒她吗？","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"再等等。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"charslot","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"......为什么活下来的不是你？","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"为什么......为什么该死的维多利亚人......他们的孩子能活？","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"维多利亚人的......孩子？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"......为什么......","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"呼......嗬——","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"没关系，亲爱的——我会纠正它——","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"等着我，尼亚尔......等着我，亲爱的！","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"呜......","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"......呜......呜！","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"我见不到你了，亲爱的！我见不到你......","id":207},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"为什么，为什么？！","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"杀死你的维多利亚人，他们已经被赶跑了！","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"就连最后那个维多利亚坏种，也已经在我眼前......死掉了......","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的居民","text":"尼亚尔......","id":212},{"type":"dialog","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"艾玛滚烫的额头上满是汗珠，连绵噩梦让她无意识地抓住身下的床单，浑身止不住地颤抖着。","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"而房间里另外两个人同时站了起来。","id":216},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_59_g2_citystreets_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":224,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"宵禁已经开始一段时间了，我们现在真的能自由行动吗？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我带着你。如果黑雾真的要吞噬我们中的任何一个，就让它来试试看。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"等等，堡垒那边有人走过来了！","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"谁？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"好像是深池的人，是......","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/38/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“校官”先生！","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"他怎么了？好像丢了魂一样......","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"“校官”！！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"谁？！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"拉芙希妮小姐？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"拉芙希妮小姐，现在，回到......","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“校官”先生，出什么事了？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"不。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"今晚没有任何事发生。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“校官”先生，城中粮荒的事情已经有线索了。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这间粮店的老板艾玛受“官僚”指使，一直在把粮食偷偷运出纳斯尔纱走私。如果动作够快，我们还能把粮食追回来。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"是“官僚”？我早该想到他——","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"可是太晚了，一切都太晚了。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"为什么太晚了？难道你知道了粮食的下落？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"multiline","name":"校官","text":"不是粮食，而是......","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"multiline","name":"校官","text":"我。我们。","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"拉芙希妮小姐，感谢您的消息，但我......","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“校官”先生，到底出了什么事？告诉我！","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"不，今晚没有任何事发生。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......我不知道到底出了什么事，才能让你这样的人，为了一个理想不惜夺走那么多人生命的......战士，变成现在这个样子。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但你和深池，你们踩着那么多人的尸骸建立这个国度，就是为了把自己的同胞困在城中饿死吗？","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"......","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"不，拉芙希妮小姐，决不。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"多谢您的消息，我......我会自己去解决这个问题。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"只是，以后别再提起深池这个词。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"还有，既然我已经答应您，今晚您就无论如何不要再踏上街道一步，更不要像这样，带着无关紧要的人破坏宵禁。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校官","text":"这是为了你们好。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":294},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":295},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"2.5","id":296},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮还想说些什么，校官却不想再回应。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"他转了个身，拖着沉重的步伐，往城外的方向走去。","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我们真的要像他说的一样躲起来吗？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......不，提奥的事应该立刻告诉涅梅丝。你知道她住哪里吗？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"离这里有些远，几乎在整个纳斯尔纱的另一头。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我们这就过去。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_59_g2_citystreets_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝家就在前面。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"一路顺利，看来今晚雾气没有渗进城里......","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝，你在家吗？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"涅梅丝？","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"对了，涅梅丝不是说她晚上要参加深池的庆功会吗？难道她还没回来？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_4177_brigid_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“校官”刚刚是从堡垒的方向往外走，庆功会应该结束了才对......","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"拉芙希妮小姐......布莉吉？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮正想开口，忽然对上了涅梅丝的眼睛。","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"她的双眼甚至比刚刚的校官更加无神。","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"涅梅丝，到底怎么了，难道庆功会上出了什么事？","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1694_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不，今天晚上没有任何事情发生......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"等等，你们怎么在这里？！","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"快，快进屋！今晚千万别在街上逗留！","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g8_blackforest_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_01","fade":"true","fadetime":"0.5","layer":"1","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"就在涅梅丝手忙脚乱地拉着拉芙希妮和布莉吉进屋的时候，校官已经走出了纳斯尔纱。","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"他走入林中，走向黑暗，一直走进黑雾的最深处。","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blacksmoke_02","fade":"true","fadetime":"3","layer":"2","id":371},{"type":"bgeffect","layer":"1","fadetime":"2.5","id":372},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_bg_59_g9_blackforest_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carriage_loop","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"ca","id":374},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ca","fadetime":"5","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"片刻之后，先前被运出纳斯尔纱的粮食从黑林中缓缓现出形迹。","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"它们将在天亮前回到纳斯尔纱的农业地块。","id":378},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":380},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":381},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":382},{"type":"bgeffect","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_bg_59_g1_citystreets_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":386},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":387,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"粮荒在天亮后得到了一定程度的缓解，校官却没有从黑林中回来，尽管这没有得到任何人的关心。","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"那些奇迹般地出现在农业地块，随后流向各条街上的粮店的粮食，比真正能解决问题所需的数量少了不止一点。","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"而那一夜后就再也没能回来的人，尽管城里的人还不知道，却绝不仅仅只有一个校官。","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"无论如何，太阳无情地再次爬到人们头顶。","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"红龙和离群的守灵人走上街头，震惊地看着那些已成常态的厮打与攻讦逐渐演化成更激烈的伤害。","id":394},{"type":"dialog","id":395},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"而游牧人敲响了铁匠的门，她正要为他带来一个不幸的消息。","id":398},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":401},{"type":"charslot","id":402},{"type":"image","id":403}],"characters":["“官僚”","“酷吏”","“拷问者”","“监察官”","爱布拉娜","官僚","酷吏","监察官","拷问者","神秘的女性","作家","布莉吉","拉芙希妮","担忧的居民","校官","涅梅丝"]}